---
/** The locked hero. Copy approved Sep 2026; change only with sign-off. */
---
<section class="hero on-green">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1><span class="q">Wondering if bankruptcy is the right decision?</span><span class="w">We got you.</span></h1>
    <p>Sometimes it is. Sometimes it isn't.</p>
    <p>We help you find answers and point you in the right direction (even if it's not bankruptcy).</p>
    <p>No pressure. No judgment. Browse freely.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .hero { background: var(--sage); color: #fff; padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 3.75rem) clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3rem); }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1.1rem; max-width: 22ch; line-height: 1.08; }
  .q { display: block; font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 3.1vw, 2.375rem); font-weight: 500; color: var(--on-sage-soft); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .w { display: block; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.8vw, 5.25rem); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; }
  p { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; max-width: none; }
  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>
